{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel back in time to a land where trains and dinosaurs roam together! Build your railway through lush cherry groves and roaring volcanoes. Meet the towering Brachiosaurus, the gentle Triceratops, and the mighty T-Rex. Fly alongside Pteranodons, collect dino eggs, and hop aboard the special Dino Hood Engine to explore this prehistoric playground. Adventure, charm, and a touch of Jurassic wonder await!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This pack contains</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The erupting volcano</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The red T-Rex!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three flying Pteranodons - a black, green and yellow!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three friendly Brachiosauruses to place in your world or in wagons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Triceratopses\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two new railway pieces - one with lava!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special Dino Hood Locomotives - watch it open its hood!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special edition wagon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue, red, green &amp; purple eggs cargo to place in your world or in your wagons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two pretty new trees - the vibrant cherry tree and Lava trees</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933450?t=1762517686","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3933450?t=1762517686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933450/68874499e5dcb9e9cf0ce9d57af6bc57dc8652c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762517686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3933450/68874499e5dcb9e9cf0ce9d57af6bc57dc8652c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762517686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Dow